SELECT
  fullVisitorId,
  MIN(date) AS first_visit_date,
  MAX(date) AS last_visit_date
FROM `bigquery-public-data.google_analytics_sample.ga_sessions_*`
GROUP BY fullVisitorId
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description:  Query 6 – Using the same wildcard scan, keep only sessions
--              that recorded a transaction and, for each user, capture the
--              first (earliest) date on which they transacted.
